<title>UK: Mersey Docks year pretax falls.</title>
<headline>Mersey Docks year pretax falls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.77		  vs 24.48</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.75		   vs 7.85</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 12.75		  vs 11.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     29.7		   vs 31.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   149.7		  vs 138</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said 1996 turnover included 5.7 million stg from acquisitions.</p>
<p>Mersey Docks and Harbour Co also said a dispute with former employees at the Port of Liverpool reduced 1996 operating profits by about 800,000 stg.</p>
<p>The company's 1996 profits also include trading losses and closure costs of 9.1 million stg for Eurolink Ferries.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
